  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The documents/information submitted, in the absence of any conflicting evidence, is satisfactory to prove, on the balance of probabilities, that the property at No.&amp;nbsp;401 Northolt Road, South Harrow, Harrow, HA2 8JE&amp;nbsp;has been in use as two&amp;nbsp;self-contained residential units for a continuous period of at least 4 years prior to the date of this application. The existing development is therefore considered to be lawful.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The use of the property&amp;nbsp;at No.401 Northolt Road, South Harrow, Harrow, HA2 8JE, as two&amp;nbsp;self-contained residential units at first floor level, is immune from enforcement action and is therefore lawful under S.171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
